{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/extras/b84a97491f7615ec2eef1e5715ae0c1a.poster.avif?t=1757405568\" width=960 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/extras/b84a97491f7615ec2eef1e5715ae0c1a.webm?t=1757405568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/extras/b84a97491f7615ec2eef1e5715ae0c1a.mp4?t=1757405568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2\u201312 players in this social-deduction survival game. Host private matches with friends or join public lobbies. Your plane crashed on a remote island! Gather food and scavenge for clothes to survive cold and hunger. But beware, some of you are secretly cannibals trying to take everyone out before help shows up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/extras/a1f6777ae9bb9eb0970a17c348bd3119.avif?t=1757405568\" width=1560 height=341 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passenger Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough until the rescue boat shows up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, hunt, gather food and clothes to keep your energy up and not be vulnerable to cannibal attacks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to be back to the camp by nightfall or else\u2026\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote to eliminate suspected cannibals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/extras/48279785c5f0485b5ce21f98d3ab3290.avif?t=1757405568\" width=1560 height=341 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cannibal Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill and eat passengers before the rescue boat arrives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage! Poison food, burn clothes, infest tents to make passengers become vulnerable quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretend to contribute to the camp needs to blend in with the passengers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat / text chat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your games, balance resource generation, role distribution or timers to suit your group\u2019s style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Bots to fill-up lobbies, but beware though, some may behave\u2026unexpectedtly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters and cosmetics\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004990?t=1757405568","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/3c2e1a3ae714382a3c26de22c70b129ac1febd67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757405568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/5844e7c0ab7e457361b008fd7c753e8c6e52ca04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757405568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004990/5844e7c0ab7e457361b008fd7c753e8c6e52ca04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757405568","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","